   // JasperInnKeeper (Widow Qesino)
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_001 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, he is a longtime resident of Jasper.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_002 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"An ~Iassassin~I? Who was assassinated?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_003 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I know that Barloque is the home of "
      "Meridian's royal family. Our own Yevitan, at the Royal Bank here in "
      "Jasper, was a close advisor to King Zarcos IV and lived there for "
      "many years before he came back to Jasper.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_004 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Although I have yet to travel to Barloque, "
      "it is sure to be very grand.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_005 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Oh, no, you mustn't leave now... it isn't "
      "safe to travel the mountains at night.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_006 = "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Good %s to you.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_007 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I'm fresh out of chicken soup. Would you "
      "care for a bowl of faroni stew?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_008 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Cor Noth is due north and on the plains. "
      "They are very idealistic people there.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_009 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I'm afraid I've never been to Cor Noth. "
      "I'm sure it is a very decent place.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_010 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"They are very wise, I know that, but what "
      "can they do for all these troubles? People need to take more on "
      "themselves, take control of their own lives.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_011 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"The politics of the council are far "
      "removed from the simple life we lead in Jasper.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_012 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I shed no tears for Kalior.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_013 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino snorts, \"I'm sure we're just an after-thought to "
      "him, if he thinks of us at all.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_014 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"That whelp thought he had his hold on us "
      "didn't he. He found out the hard way that he was dead wrong.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_015 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"What are you talking about, anyway?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_016 = "~kThe Widow Qesino smiles at you warmly."
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_017 = "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Welcome.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_018 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Come in and warm yourself near the fire.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_019 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"My husband disappeared some time ago. He "
      "has been missing these many months, and they told me he was presumed "
      "dead when they gave up the search.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_020 = "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I am a widow.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_021 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"This town will make a name for itself yet. "
      " Now that we have Jonas and his rebels here they can't just ignore us "
      "any longer.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_022 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"The talk is really picking up here. I "
      "wonder if there will be action behind those words.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_023 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"He's a good man at heart, almost fits in "
      "with us mountain folk.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_024 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I'm not really sure if he is our salvation "
      "or latest downfall, it's a tossup really.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_025 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Who got ~Ikilled~I?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_026 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"My sister and her husband settled in "
      "Marion after the mines closed. It is a lovely town. The people there "
      "are very witty, yes, always making jokes.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_027 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Marion is just out of the mountains, on "
      "the other side of the great forest of Farol. Yes, some of the farmers "
      "from those parts come up to Jasper regularly to sell their goods at "
      "market.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_028 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"From what folks tell me, she's just a "
      "lonely, lost child looking for someone to show her some love.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_029 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"She's only a little girl that nobody "
      "listens to anyway. What would you do if people pestered you like "
      "that?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_030 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"And what if she really is telling the "
      "truth.  Who would care anyway?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_031 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"If she's not from around here, then I "
      "don't care.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_032 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Out with you, before you bring misfortune "
      "into my house. Off with you, shoo!\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_033 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Murder? Someone was ~Imurdered~I?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_034 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I've already sent out all my "
      "correspondences for the day.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_035 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"She says we should ask the council, heh, "
      "but honestly, I never believed those slimeballs. I always figured "
      "they were hiding something.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_036 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Us mountain folk get by fine without all "
      "the extras; if something gets taken from us, we just live without it. "
      "It's kind of funny, somehow, watching them all, completely beside "
      "themselves, just over those silly mana nodes.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_037 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, the orcs cause many problems for "
      "those who must travel in these mountains.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_038 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, Pietro... well, he has a little "
      "problem with his drinking.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_039 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"He runs the tavern. He should still be "
      "open, you'll find it just up the street.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_040 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Bless her heart, she is left to look after "
      "the throne when the land is in such a ~Imess~I, from what I "
      "understand. Goes to show you that happiness does not come with great "
      "wealth and power.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_041 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"She seems very kind, naive, but kind.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_042 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Can't much see her highness hiking up her "
      "skirts and strolling through the mountains to Jasper.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_043 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, Quintor is the blacksmith in Jasper. "
      "His shop is just across the way, if you need any metalwork.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_044 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, he is a boarder here and he runs the "
      "blacksmith shop just across the way. A very fine blacksmith too, as "
      "you can see for yourself, he has made many of the things here at the "
      "inn.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_045 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"It's about time Jasper had a regular "
      "militia, specially with all them city folk wandering about as of "
      "late.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_046 = \
      "~kThe room goes silent as %s mentions stunted dwarf."
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_047 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yevitan at the Royal Bank here in Jasper "
      "used to work closely with another bank, which is in Tos. You can do "
      "business with either one. My late husband didn't trust Yevitan, and "
      "would make the trip to Tos just to conduct business. He... well, when "
      "he left here for Tos the last time, he went missing. Never showed up "
      "in Tos, and no one has seen him here.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_048 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, it's a big city north of here some "
      "distance. My late husband frequently traveled there on business.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_049 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Trolls are ~Ivery~I wicked.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_050 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"He is a very clever businessman, he was "
      "once a close advisor to the King on such matters. That is quite an "
      "accomplishment for someone from Jasper, because we are looked down "
      "upon by the people from other towns.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_051 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Yes, that is the banker in Jasper. An "
      "honest man.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_speech_052 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Do you know him?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_001 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"You won't have much trouble with the rats "
      "and the baby spiders you will see in these parts, but be very careful "
      "of the trolls and the orcs!\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_002 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"There now, don't you feel better for "
      "havin' eaten?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_003 = "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Bless you.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_004 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I can make you something to eat if you are "
      "hungry. \""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_005 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"When you need to rest and get your "
      "strength back, go to an inn. You are safe here.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_006 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Are you sure that you're not hungry? I've "
      "just done the shopping, and you look as though you could use a good "
      "meal.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_007 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"You look as though you've come a long way. "
      "I'm sure that Jasper must seem quite backwards to you.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_008 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Are you warming up? Let me stoke the fire "
      "a bit.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_009 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"You'll catch a chill in these mountains at "
      "night.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_010 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"Can I get you anything?\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_011 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"I want you to leave my inn.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_random_012 = \
      "~kThe Widow Qesino says, \"You must leave here.\""
   jasperinnkeeper_trigger_afiera_d_xor = "afiera d'xor"
